{
  "_doc": [
    "Pack reward ladder specification (D21). SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH — read by",
    "harness/_solve_packs.js (calibration) and builders/_build_packrewards.py (xlsx emit).",
    "",
    "Each block is one reward ladder the engine actually reads. Row indices are 0-BASED into",
    "sheetVals_() and match LB_R_SPECS / COLL_R_SPECS / PACK_ONLY_SPECS in EcoGainsSim_v4.gs.",
    "colBase = column index of the '1-star Dly' column for THAT block (star N -> colBase+N-1);",
    "given explicitly because SP_v2 carries two full reward blocks (Free track at 17, Paid at 37)",
    "and a header-name lookup would silently bind to the wrong one.",
    "",
    "dir: 'rank'      -> the GOOD end of the ladder is r0 (rank 1 is best)",
    "     'milestone' -> the GOOD end is r1 (highest milestone = most play)",
    "",
    "tiers: {'<star>': {frac, every}} -> take the first ceil(frac * nRows) rows from the GOOD end,",
    "then keep every 'every'-th of those (default 1). Value written is ALWAYS 1 — the",
    "'one pack per star per ladder row' rule. Tiers accumulate going up by construction: a",
    "broader frac reaches further down the ladder, so better play collects strictly more tiers.",
    "",
    "WHITELIST (user table, 2026-08-04): 1*/2* only on Season Pass Free, Photoshoot, Jigsaw,",
    "Hatchling Hideaway, Bomb's Ballet, Rainbow Maker. 3*/4* on Red, Chuck, Bomb, Flash Race,",
    "Flock Flurry, Kite Festival, Target Day, Rainbow Maker, Night Sky (+Team Event on 4*).",
    "5* on Season Pass Paid, Team Event, Rainbow Maker. 6*/Gold: no source, stays 0 everywhere.",
    "Team Race dropped (no config sheet). Level Race deliberately absent though it shares Race_v2.",
    "tiers may instead give an explicit 'rows' list (0-based sheet rows) for an authored ramp with uneven spacing; 'scale' does not apply to those.",
    "tiers may set from='low' to anchor sampling at the ENTRY end of the ladder (used for 1-star, so low-progress players earn the entry tier)."
